-- A computed message name in `send` (ADR 0057): broken sources in the format
-- of ../broken.talk. `bun tools/grammar/check.ts` checks them. The Cores'
-- tests don't read this file yet; its cases move into ../broken.talk once
-- both Cores parse a computed name.
-- case: a computed message name has no target-first form
-- expect: unexpected token at 2:15
on t
  send to me: (next) order
end t
-- case: a computed message name must be closed before `with`
-- expect: unexpected token at 2:14
on t
  send (next with order to me
end t
